<header class="bg-inverse pb-16 pt-32 text-inverse-ink md:pb-20 md:pt-40">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 text-center">
        <p class="mb-4 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">In-home visits</p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight md:text-6xl">House Rules.</h1>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-inverse-ink/75 md:text-xl">
            A short guide to keeping every visit safe, respectful and straightforward.
        </p>
    </div>
</header>

<div class="bg-canvas py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-8 px-6">
        <section class="rounded-3xl border border-accent/35 bg-accent/10 p-8 md:p-10" aria-labelledby="respect-heading">
            <h2 id="respect-heading" class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink">Respect and safety</h2>
            <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/75">
                Naked Tech technicians are professionals and must be treated respectfully. Harassment, threats, inappropriate touching, discriminatory conduct or an unsafe environment may cause a visit to stop immediately. The technician may leave when they reasonably believe it is unsafe to continue.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="rounded-3xl border border-line bg-surface p-8 md:p-10" aria-labelledby="access-heading">
            <h2 id="access-heading" class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink">Safe access</h2>
            <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/75">
                Please provide safe access to the agreed devices, equipment and work area, keep pets or other hazards clear where reasonably needed, and make sure an adult authorised to approve the work is present.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="rounded-3xl border border-line bg-surface p-8 md:p-10" aria-labelledby="data-heading">
            <h2 id="data-heading" class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink">Your data and credentials</h2>
            <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/75">
                You enter passwords, authentication codes and recovery details yourself. Naked Tech does not record, photograph, copy, transmit or retain them. If agreed work requires access to personal files, we explain why and ask you to remain present. Please maintain a current backup before work begins wherever practicable.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="rounded-3xl border border-line bg-surface p-8 md:p-10" aria-labelledby="bookings-heading">
            <h2 id="bookings-heading" class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink">Bookings and cancellations</h2>
            <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/75">
                Please give as much notice as possible if plans change. The cancellation rules, charges and exceptions are set out in the <a href="/service-terms/#cancellations" class="font-bold text-accent-ink underline hover:text-ink">Customer Service Terms</a>.
            </p>
        </section>

        <aside class="rounded-3xl bg-inverse p-8 text-inverse-ink md:p-10" aria-labelledby="full-terms-heading">
            <h2 id="full-terms-heading" class="text-2xl font-bold">The full terms still apply.</h2>
            <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-inverse-ink/75">
                These House Rules are a practical summary. They do not replace the Customer Service Terms or your rights under the Australian Consumer Law.
            </p>
            <div class="mt-7 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
                <a href="/service-terms/" class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent px-6 py-3 font-bold text-ivanhoe-slate transition hover:bg-[#FF7A50]">Read the service terms</a>
                <a href="/privacy/" class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-inverse-ink/30 px-6 py-3 font-bold transition hover:border-accent hover:text-accent">Read the privacy policy</a>
            </div>
        </aside>
